  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo tells Fang Zheng that the clan’s deepest research on Moonlight Gu includes two rank five recipes. Fang Zheng already holds Jade Skin Gu and Moonlight Gu, which satisfies one of those recipes. Following it through multiple fusions would eventually yield rank five Moonlight Treasure King Gu. Bo then sets that rank five result aside as too early to dwell on, and teaches the rank two first step, Moon Raiment, instead.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
